      {
        "annotationBody": "Scene Switcher uses source_mode Groups to collect both Group Output textures wirelessly. Change selected_group for cuts and fade_time for crossfades on Out. Out is a texture and Scene Switcher has no numeric control output. To drive another numeric parameter, use a contributing look control such as ref(\"Green_Look/control_outputs/value\") on the target parameter.",
